#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Syslog Upgrade Advisor"
msgstr "Umeluleki Wokuthuthukisa i-Syslog"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Upgrade Syslog from %s to %s? Existing messages and rules will be preserved. Schema changes may take time."
msgstr "Thuthukisa i-Syslog ukusuka ku-%s kuya ku-%s? Imilayezo nemithetho ekhona izogcinwa. Izinguquko ze-schema zingathatha isikhathi."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "What upgrade/install type do you wish to use"
msgstr "Iluphi uhlobo lokuthuthukisa/lokufaka ofisa ukulusebenzisa"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "When you have very large tables, performing a Truncate will be much quicker.  If you are concerned about archive data, you can choose either Inline, which will freeze your browser for the period of this upgrade, or background, which will create a background process to bring your old syslog data from a backup table to the new syslog format.  Again this process can take several hours.  A Truncate discards the stored syslog and removed messages only; alert, removal and report rules are always kept."
msgstr "Uma unamathebula amakhulu kakhulu, ukwenza i-Truncate kuzoshesha kakhulu. Uma ukhathazekile ngedatha elondoloziwe, ungakhetha phakathi kwe-Inline, ezokwenza isiphequluli sakho sime phakathi nesikhathi salokhu kuthuthukiswa, noma ngemuva (background), okuzodala inqubo yangemuva yokuletha idatha yakho endala ye-syslog kusuka kuthebula lokulondoloza kuya kufomethi entsha ye-syslog. Futhi le nqubo ingathatha amahora amaningana. I-Truncate ilahla imiyalezo ye-syslog egciniwe nesusiwe kuphela; imithetho yezexwayiso, yokususa neyombiko ihlala igcinwa njalo."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Truncate Syslog Table"
msgstr "Hlanza Ithebula Le-Syslog"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Inline Upgrade"
msgstr "Ukuthuthukisa ngaphakathi"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Background Upgrade"
msgstr "Ukuthuthukisa Ngemuva"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Database Storage Engine"
msgstr "Injini Yokugcina Yedathabheyisi"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The storage engine for the analytical tables.  Only InnoDB and, on MariaDB, Aria storage engines are supported.  Any Remote Data Collector option requires InnoDB; incompatible combinations cannot be submitted."
msgstr "Injini yokugcina yamathebula okuhlaziya. Izinjini zokugcina ze-InnoDB kuphela kanye, ku-MariaDB, i-Aria ezisekelwayo. Noma yikuphi ukukhetha kwe-Remote Data Collector kudinga i-InnoDB; izinhlanganisela ezingahambelani azikwazi ukuthunyelwa."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "InnoDB Storage"
msgstr "Isitoreji se-InnoDB"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria Storage"
msgstr "Isitoreji se-Aria"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Timestamp Precision"
msgstr "Ukunemba Kwesitembu Sesikhathi"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond precision stores sub-second syslog timestamps in a TIMESTAMP(3) column and is only available on MariaDB.  Second precision uses a standard TIMESTAMP column.  On a production system, use cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms during a maintenance window to convert existing messages without discarding them."
msgstr "Ukunemba kwemilisekhondi kugcina izitembu zesikhathi ze-syslog ezingaphansi kwesekhondi kukholomu ye-TIMESTAMP(3) futhi kutholakala kuphela ku-MariaDB. Ukunemba kwesekhondi kusebenzisa ikholomu ejwayelekile ye-TIMESTAMP. Ohlelweni olusebenzayo, sebenzisa i-cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms ngesikhathi sewindi lokulungisa ukuze uguqule imilayezo ekhona ngaphandle kokuyilahla."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond - TIMESTAMP(3) (MariaDB only)"
msgstr "Imilisekhondi - TIMESTAMP(3) (MariaDB kuphela)"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Second - TIMESTAMP"
msgstr "Isekhondi - TIMESTAMP"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Message Processing"
msgstr "Ukucubungula Imilayezo Okude"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Remote Data Collector Message Processing"
msgstr "Nika amandla Ukucutshungulwa Kwemilayezo Yomqoqi Wedatha Okude"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process their messages independently, check this checkbox.  By checking this Checkbox, your Remote Data Collectors will need to maintain their own 'config_local.php' file in order to inform Syslog to use an independent database for message display and processing.  Please use the template file 'config_local.php.dist' for this purpose.  WARNING: Syslog tables will be automatically created as soon as this option is enabled."
msgstr "Uma Abaqoqi Bedatha Bakude banazo izizindalwazi zabo ze-Syslog futhi becubungula imilayezo yabo ngokuzimela, khetha leli bhokisi lokuhlola. Ngokukhetha leli Bhokisi lokuhlola, Abaqoqi Bedatha Bakude bazodinga ukugcina ifayela labo le-'config_local.php' ukuze bazise i-Syslog ukuthi isebenzise isizindalwazi esizimele ekuboniseni nasekucubunguleni imilayezo. Sicela usebenzise ifayela lesifanekiso elithi 'config_local.php.dist' kulokhu. ISEXWAYISO: Amathebula e-Syslog azokwakhiwa ngokuzenzakalelayo ngokushesha nje lapho le nketho inikwa amandla."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Data Collector Rules Sync"
msgstr "Ukuvumelanisa Imithetho Yomqoqi Wedatha Okude"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process thrie messages independently, check this checkbox if you wish the Main Cacti databases Alerts, Removal and Report rules to be sent to the Remote Cacti System."
msgstr "Uma Abaqoqi Bedatha Bakude banazo izizindalwazi zabo ze-Syslog futhi becubungula imilayezo yabo ngokuzimela, khetha leli bhokisi lokuhlola uma ufisa ukuthi Imithetho Yezexwayiso, Yokukhipha kanye Neyemibiko yesizindalwazi esikhulu se-Cacti ithunyelwe kuHlelo Lwe-Cacti Olukude."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Store Records on Remote Collector"
msgstr "Londoloza Amarekhodi Kumqoqi Okude"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep processed messages in the remote collector syslog table after they have been delivered to the Main Collector. When disabled, records are retained locally only while the Main Collector is unavailable and are removed after confirmed recovery delivery."
msgstr "Gcina imilayezo esicutshunguliwe etafuleni le-syslog yomqoqi okude ngemva kokuba ilethwe kuMqoqi Omkhulu. Uma kukhutshaziwe, amarekhodi agcinwa endaweni kuphela ngenkathi uMqoqi Omkhulu engatholakali futhi ayasuswa ngemva kokuqinisekiswa kokulethwa kokubuyisela."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Retention Policy"
msgstr "Inqubomgomo Yokugcina"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Choose how many days of Syslog values you wish to maintain in the database."
msgstr "Khetha ukuthi zingaki izinsuku zamanani e-Syslog ofisa ukuzigcina kudathabheyisi."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Partitioning Level"
msgstr "Izinga Lokuhlukanisa Ngezingxenye"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables.  Daily is recommended.  Hourly requires a finite retention, and the retention and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit.  To change the level later, change it in Settings and run cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."
msgstr "Usayizi wengxenye ngayinye yamathebula e-syslog kanye ne-syslog_removed. Okwansuku zonke kunconywa. Okwehora ngalinye kudinga ukugcinwa okunomkhawulo, futhi ukugcinwa kanye nezinga lokuhlukanisa ndawonye kufanele kulingane nomkhawulo wokuhlukanisa weseva yesizindalwazi. Ukuze ushintshe izinga kamuva, lishintshe ku-Izilungiselelo bese ugijima i-cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Thuthukisa"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Faka"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Syslog %s Advisor"
msgstr "Umeluleki we-Syslog %s"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "WARNING: Syslog Upgrade is Time Consuming!!!"
msgstr "ISEXWAYISO: Ukuthuthukiswa kwe-Syslog Kudla Isikhathi!!!"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The upgrade of the 'main' syslog table can be a very time consuming process.  As such, it is recommended that you either reduce the size of your syslog table prior to upgrading, or choose the background option."
msgstr "Ukuthuthukiswa kwethebula le-syslog elithi 'main' kungaba inqubo edla isikhathi esiningi kakhulu. Ngakho-ke, kunconywa ukuthi unciphise usayizi wethebula lakho le-syslog ngaphambi kokuthuthukisa, noma ukhethe inketho yangemuva."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "If you choose the background option, your legacy syslog table will be renamed, and a new syslog table will be created.  Then, an upgrade process will be launched in the background.  Again, this background process can take quite a bit of time to complete.  However, your data will be preserved."
msgstr "Uma ukhetha inketho yangemuva, ithebula lakho elidala le-syslog lizoqanjwa kabusha, futhi kuzokwakhiwa ithebula elisha le-syslog. Bese, inqubo yokuthuthukisa izoqaliswa ngemuva. Futhi, le nqubo yangemuva ingathatha isikhathi eside ukuthi iqede. Nokho, idatha yakho izogcinwa."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Regardless of your choice, all existing removal and alert rules will be maintained during the upgrade process."
msgstr "Kungakhathaliseki ukuthi ukhethani, yonke imithetho ekhona yokususa neyezexwayiso izogcinwa ngesikhathi sokuthuthukisa."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Press <b>'Upgrade'</b> to proceed with the upgrade, or <b>'Cancel'</b> to return to the Plugins menu."
msgstr "Cindezela u-<b>'Thuthukisa'</b> ukuze uqhubeke nokuthuthukisa, noma u-<b>'Khansela'</b> ukuze ubuyele kumenyu yama-Plugin."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also set the database storage engine for the analytical tables syslog and syslog_remove.  Only the InnoDB storage engine and, on MariaDB, the Aria storage engine are supported.  If using MariaDB, we recommend the Aria Storage Engine when no Remote Data Collector options are enabled; collector options require InnoDB."
msgstr "Ungasetha nenjini yokugcina yedathabheyisi yamathebula okuhlaziya athi syslog kanye ne-syslog_remove. Kuphela injini yokugcina ye-InnoDB futhi, ku-MariaDB, injini yokugcina ye-Aria esekelwayo. Uma usebenzisa i-MariaDB, sincoma i-Aria Storage Engine lapho kungekho zinketho ze-Remote Data Collector ezinikwe amandla; izinketho zomqoqi zidinga i-InnoDB."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You have several options to choose from when installing Syslog.  The first is the Database Architecture.  Partitioned tables are the only supported architecture as they prevent the size of the tables from becoming excessive thus slowing queries.  Traditional non-partitioned tables are deprecated and are no longer offered for new installs."
msgstr "Unezinketho eziningana ongakhetha kuzo uma ufaka i-Syslog. Eyokuqala yi-Database Architecture. Amathebula ahlukanisiwe (partitioned tables) ukuphela kwezakhiwo ezisekelwayo njengoba evimbela ukuba usayizi wamathebula ungabi mkhulu kakhulu okunciphisa isivinini semibuzo. Amathebula ajwayelekile angahlukanisiwe ayekiwe ukusetshenziswa futhi awasanikezwa ekufakweni okusha."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also choose the timestamp precision.  Millisecond precision (TIMESTAMP(3)) preserves sub-second ordering of incoming messages and is only available on MariaDB; MySQL installs use second precision.  This cannot be changed in place later without destroying the stored messages."
msgstr "Ungakhetha nokunemba kwesitembu sesikhathi. Ukunemba kwesigidi somzuzwana (TIMESTAMP(3)) kugcina ukuhleleka kwangaphansi komzuzwana kwemiyalezo engenayo futhi kutholakala ku-MariaDB kuphela; ukufakwa kwe-MySQL kusebenzisa ukunemba komzuzwana. Lokhu ngeke kushintshwe khona lapho kamuva ngaphandle kokubhubhisa imiyalezo egciniwe."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria storage is unavailable while any Remote Data Collector option is enabled. InnoDB has been selected."
msgstr "Isitoreji se-Aria asitholakali ngenkathi noma iyiphi inketho ye-Remote Data Collector inikwe amandla. Kukhethwe i-InnoDB."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also select the retention duration.  Please keep in mind that if you have several hosts logging to syslog, this table can become quite large."
msgstr "Ungakhetha nesikhathi sokugcina. Sicela ukhumbule ukuthi uma unosingathi abaningana abaloga ku-syslog, leli thebula lingakhula kakhulu."

