#: includes/settings.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo Ezivamile"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "I-Syslog Inikwe Amandla"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, records will be transferred from the Syslog Incoming table to the main syslog table and Alerts and Reports will be enabled.  Please keep in mind that if the system is disabled log entries will still accumulate into the Syslog Incoming table as this is defined by the rsyslog or syslog-ng process."
msgstr "Uma leli bhokisi lokuhlola likhethiwe, amarekhodi azodluliselwa ukusuka kuthebula le-Syslog Incoming aye kuthebula elikhulu le-syslog futhi Izexwayiso Nemibiko kuzonikwa amandla. Sicela ukhumbule ukuthi uma uhlelo lukhutshaziwe, okufakiwe kwamalogi kuzoqhubeka kuqoqana kuthebula le-Syslog Incoming njengoba lokhu kuchazwe inqubo ye-rsyslog noma ye-syslog-ng."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Forward alarms to Alarm Manager"
msgstr "Dlulisela ama-alamu KuMphathi Wama-alamu"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allow rules set to Alarm Manager to forward alarms. Syslog email remains the fallback; command actions run only for Syslog Alarming rules."
msgstr "Vumela imithetho esethwe ku-Alarm Manager ukuthi idlulisele phambili ama-alamu. I-imeyili ye-Syslog ihlala iyisipele; izenzo zemiyalo zisebenza kuphela emithethweni ye-Syslog Alarming."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Strip Domains"
msgstr "Susa Izizinda"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "A comma delimited list of domains that you wish to remove from the syslog hostname, Examples would be 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"
msgstr "Uhlu lwezizinda oluhlukaniswe ngokhefana ofisa ukuzisusa egameni lomsingathi le-Syslog, Izibonelo zingaba 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Refresh Interval"
msgstr "Isikhathi sokuvuselela"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the time in seconds before the page refreshes."
msgstr "Lesi isikhathi ngamasekhondi ngaphambi kokuba ikhasi livuselelwe."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip Total Row Count"
msgstr "Yeqa Ukubalwa Kwemigqa Sekukonke"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the System Logs and Alert Logs tabs do not count every matching record, which can be very expensive on large installations. The page shows Previous and Next links instead of a total and page list, and Next is offered while more records remain."
msgstr "Uma leli bhokisi lokuhlola likhethiwe, amathebhu we-System Logs kanye ne-Alert Logs awabali wonke amarekhodi afanayo, okungabiza kakhulu ekufakweni okukhulu. Ikhasi libonisa izixhumanisi zokuthi Okwedlule nokuthi Okulandelayo esikhundleni sesamba nohlu lwamakhasi, futhi Okulandelayo kunikezwa ngenkathi kusekhona amarekhodi asele."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Max Report Records"
msgstr "Amarekhodi Ombiko Aphezulu"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "For Threshold based Alerts, what is the maximum number that you wish to show in the report.  This is used to limit the size of the html log and Email."
msgstr "Kuzexwayiso ezisuselwe Kumkhawulo, iyiphi inombolo ephezulu ofisa ukuyibonisa embikweni.  Lokhu kusetshenziselwa ukukhawulela usayizi welogi ye-html kanye Ne-imeyili."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Records"
msgstr "Amarekhodi angu-%d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum Syslog Processing Processes"
msgstr "Inani Eliphezulu Lezinqubo Zokucubungula i-Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When set above 1, incoming message processing is spread across parallel worker processes.  Each worker handles a disjoint range of incoming messages, speeding up hostname resolution and message transfer under heavy loads.  A setting of 1 processes all messages in a single process.  Worker processes are not supported on Windows or when the PHP pcntl and POSIX extensions are unavailable, in which case processing falls back to a single process."
msgstr "Uma isethwe ngaphezu kuka-1, ukucutshungulwa kwemiyalezo engenayo kusatshalaliswa ezinqubweni zabasebenzi ezihambisana ngasikhathi sinye. Umsebenzi ngamunye uphatha uhla oluhlukile lwemiyalezo engenayo, okusheshisa ukutholwa kwegama lomsingathi nokudluliselwa kwemiyalezo ngaphansi komthwalo osindayo. Isilungiselelo sika-1 sicubungula yonke imiyalezo ngenqubo eyodwa. Izinqubo zabasebenzi azisekelwa ku-Windows noma lapho izandiso ze-PHP pcntl ne-POSIX zingatholakali, lapho ukucubungula kubuyela enqubweni eyodwa."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Process"
msgstr "Inqubo yokusebenza engu-%d"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Processes"
msgstr "Izinqubo zokusebenza ezingu-%d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Command for Opening Tickets"
msgstr "Umyalo Wokuvula Amathikithi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This command will be executed for opening Help Desk Tickets.  The command will be required to parse multiple input parameters as follows: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>.  The hostlist will be a comma delimited list of hosts impacted by the alert."
msgstr "Lo myalo uzosetshenziswa ukuvula Amathikithi Edeski Losizo. Umyalo uzodinga ukuhlaziya amapharamitha amaningi okufakwayo ngalolu hlelo: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>. I-hostlist izoba uhlu oluhlukaniswe ngokhefana lwabasingathi abathintwe yisexwayiso."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Host Discovery Options"
msgstr "Izinketho Zokuthola Umsingathi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Hostname Resolution"
msgstr "Nika amandla Ukuxazululwa Kwegama Lomsingathi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all hostnames are resolved via DNS lookup first (If enabled), using A and AAAA records. IPv4 and IPv6 addresses need no lookup, and IPv6 addresses are stored in compressed lower case form. If the DNS lookup fails, the system will attempt to resolve the hostname against the Cacti host table and replace it with the Cacti host description. If both DNS and Cacti lookups fail, records are assigned a prefix 'unresolved-Original_hostname'."
msgstr "Uma leli bhokisi lokuhlola likhethiwe, wonke amagama abasingathi axazululwa ngokubheka ku-DNS kuqala (Uma kunikwe amandla), kusetshenziswa amarekhodi e-A ne-AAAA. Amakheli e-IPv4 ne-IPv6 awadingi ukubhekwa, futhi amakheli e-IPv6 agcinwa ngefomu elincishisiwe elinezinhlamvu ezincane. Uma ukubheka ku-DNS kwehluleka, uhlelo luzozama ukuxazulula igama lomsingathi kuthebula lomsingathi we-Cacti bese lufaka incazelo yomsingathi we-Cacti esikhundleni salo. Uma kokubili ukubheka ku-DNS nakwe-Cacti kwehluleka, amarekhodi anikezwa isiqalo esithi 'unresolved-Original_hostname'."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip DNS Resolution for incoming hosts"
msgstr "Yeqa Ukuxazululwa kwe-DNS kwabasingathi abangenayo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the system will not attempt to resolve hosts via DNS lookups.  This is useful for environments where DNS resolution is not possible or not desired."
msgstr "Uma leli bhokisi lokuhlola likhethiwe, uhlelo ngeke luzame ukuxazulula abasingathi ngokubheka ku-DNS. Lokhu kuyasiza ezindaweni lapho ukuxazululwa kwe-DNS kungenzeki noma kungafuneki."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "HTML Notification Settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo Zesaziso Se-HTML"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable HTML Based Email"
msgstr "Nika amandla I-imeyili Esekelwe ku-HTML"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all Emails will be sent in HTML format.  Otherwise, Emails will be sent in plain text."
msgstr "Uma leli bhokisi lokuhlola likhethiwe, wonke ama-imeyili azothunyelwa ngefomethi ye-HTML. Ngaphandle kwalokho, ama-imeyili azothunyelwa ngombhalo ongenalutho."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Format File to Use"
msgstr "Ifayela Lefomethi Elizosetshenziswa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Choose the custom html wrapper and CSS file to use.  This file contains both html and CSS to wrap around your report.  If it contains more than simply CSS, you need to place a special <REPORT> tag inside of the file.  This format tag will be replaced by the report content.  These files are located in the 'formats' directory."
msgstr "Khetha ifayela lesembozo se-html yangokwezifiso ne-CSS elizosetshenziswa. Leli fayela liqukethe kokubili i-html ne-CSS yokugoqa umbiko wakho. Uma liqukethe okungaphezu kwe-CSS nje kuphela, udinga ukubeka ithegi ekhethekile engu-<REPORT> ngaphakathi kwefayela. Le thegi yefomethi izoshintshwa ngokuqukethwe kombiko. Lawa mafayela atholakala kuhla lwemibhalo lwe-'formats'."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Data Retention and Partitioning"
msgstr "Ukugcinwa Kwedatha Nokuhlukaniswa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Retention"
msgstr "Ukugcinwa kwe-Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep events."
msgstr "Leli inani lezinsuku zokugcina izenzakalo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables. A change is saved here but takes effect only when cli/upgrade_partitioning.php rebuilds both tables; until then, partition maintenance keeps the existing size. Hourly partitioning requires a finite retention. The retention, pre-create window and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit, or the settings are not saved."
msgstr "Usayizi wengxenye ngayinye yamathebula e-syslog kanye ne-syslog_removed. Ushintsho lulondolozwa lapha kodwa lusebenza kuphela uma i-cli/upgrade_partitioning.php yakha kabusha womabili amathebula; kuze kube yileso sikhathi, ukunakekelwa kokuhlukanisa kugcina usayizi okhona. Ukuhlukaniswa kwehora ngalinye kudinga ukugcinwa okunomkhawulo. Ukugcinwa, iwindi lokwakha kusengaphambili kanye nezinga lokuhlukanisa ndawonye kufanele kulingane nomkhawulo wokuhlukanisa weseva yesizindalwazi, ngaphandle kwalokho izilungiselelo azilondolozwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Pre-create Window"
msgstr "Ifasitela Lokwakha Izingxenye Ngaphambili"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days of future partitions to maintain for partitioned Syslog tables, so that new partitions are always split from an empty dMaxValue partition.  Hourly partitioning always keeps at least 2 days."
msgstr "Leli inani lezinsuku zezihlukaniso zesikhathi esizayo okufanele zigcinwe kumathebula e-Syslog ahlukanisiwe, ukuze izihlukaniso ezintsha zihlale zihlukaniswa esihlukanisweni se-dMaxValue esingenalutho.  Ukuhlukanisa ngehora kuhlala kugcinwa okungenani izinsuku ezingu-2."

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Day"
msgstr "Usuku olungu-%d"

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Days"
msgstr "Izinsuku ezingu-%d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Recovery Limit"
msgstr "Umkhawulo Wokubuyisela Izingxenye"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When partitions are missing (for example after maintenance downtime), at most this many missing partitions per table are created on each poller run.  The remaining gap heals over subsequent runs; retention pruning stays deferred until the future partition horizon is fully restored.  Applies to partitioned Syslog tables only."
msgstr "Uma izingxenye (partitions) zingekho (isibonelo ngemuva kwesikhathi sokuma kokulungiswa), okungenani leli nani lezingxenye ezingekho ithebula ngalinye liyakhiwa ekusebenzeni ngakunye kwe-Poller. Isikhala esisele siyalungiseka ekusebenzeni okulandelayo; ukususwa kokugcinwa kuhlala kuhlehlisiwe kuze kube yilapho ububanzi bezingxenye ezizayo sebuyiswe ngokugcwele. Kusebenza kumathebula e-Syslog ahlukanisiwe kuphela."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Partition per run"
msgstr "Iphathishini eyi-%d ngokusebenza ngakunye"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Partitions per run"
msgstr "Amaphathishini angu-%d ngokusebenza ngakunye"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Collector Staleness Threshold"
msgstr "Umkhawulo Wokuphelelwa Yisikhathi Komqoqi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline health alerts warn when unprocessed messages, processing completion, or queued synchronization exceed this delay. The effective delay is at least three poller intervals and 300 seconds. Set to 0 to use 300 seconds."
msgstr "Izaziso zempilo ye-Pipeline zixwayisa uma imiyalezo engakacutshungulwa, ukuqedwa kokucubungula, noma ukuvumelanisa okulindile kudlula lokhu kubambezeleka. Ukubambezeleka okusebenzayo okungenani kuyizikhawu ezintathu ze-Poller namasekhondi angu-300. Setha ku-0 ukuze usebenzise amasekhondi angu-300."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default (300 seconds)"
msgstr "Okuzenzakalelayo (imizuzwana engu-300)"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d seconds"
msgstr "imizuzwana engu-%d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Collector Backlog Threshold"
msgstr "Umkhawulo Womsebenzi Osele Womqoqi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The Syslog Status page shows a warning when more than this many messages sit unprocessed in the Syslog Incoming table.  Set to 0 to use the default of 10000 messages."
msgstr "Ikhasi Lesimo se-Syslog libonisa isexwayiso uma imilayezo engaphezu kwaleli nani ihlala ingacutshungulwanga kuthebula le-Syslog Incoming. Setha ku-0 ukuze usebenzise okuzenzakalelayo kwemilayezo engu-10000."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default (10000 messages)"
msgstr "Okuzenzakalelayo (imilayezo engu-10000)"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Messages"
msgstr "Imilayezo engu-%d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Alerts"
msgstr "Izaziso Zempilo Ye-Pipeline"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Notification List"
msgstr "Uhlu Lwezaziso Zempilo Ye-Pipeline"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Select an existing Thold notification list for pipeline health alerts. Enabled list recipients are combined with the email addresses below, preserving BCC recipients. Lists require the Thold notification-list table."
msgstr "Khetha uhlu lwezaziso lwe-Thold olukhona ukuze uthole izexwayiso zesimo se-pipeline. Abamukeli bohlu olunikwe amandla bahlanganiswa namakheli e-imeyili angezansi, kugcinwa abamukeli be-BCC. Izinhlu zidinga ithebula lohlu lwezaziso le-Thold."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Email Recipients"
msgstr "Abamukeli Be-imeyili Bempilo Ye-Pipeline"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Comma-separated email recipients for pipeline failures and recovery. Leave blank and select no notification list to disable email; health remains visible on the Status tab and state changes are logged. Checks require the Cacti poller to run."
msgstr "Abamukeli be-imeyili abahlukaniswe ngokhefana bokwehluleka kwe-pipeline nokuvuselelwa. Shiya kungenalutho futhi ungakhethi luhlu lwezaziso ukuze ukhubaze i-imeyili; isimo sempilo sihlala sibonakala kuthebhu Yesimo futhi izinguquko zesimo ziyarekhodwa. Ukuhlola kudinga ukuthi I-Poller ye-Cacti isebenze."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Reminder Interval"
msgstr "Isikhawu Sesikhumbuzo Sempilo Ye-Pipeline"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat notifications for ongoing pipeline problems after this interval. Failed email attempts are retried no more than once every five minutes."
msgstr "Phinda izaziso zezinkinga ze-pipeline eziqhubekayo ngemva kwalesi sikhathi. Imizamo ye-imeyili ehlulekile ayiphindwa ngaphezu kwakanye njalo ngemizuzu emihlanu."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Alert Retention"
msgstr "Ukugcinwa Kwezexwayiso ze-Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep alert logs."
msgstr "Leli inani lezinsuku zokugcina amalogi ama-alamu."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Suppression and Maintenance"
msgstr "Ukucindezelwa Kwezaziso Nokulungiswa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Days"
msgstr "Izinsuku Zewindi Lokulungisa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Days when all alert notifications are muted during the configured maintenance timeframe."
msgstr "Izinsuku lapho zonke izaziso zezexwayiso zithuliswa phakathi nesikhathi sokunakekelwa esilungisiwe."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Starts"
msgstr "Iwindi Lokulungisa Liqala"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Local start time for the global maintenance window."
msgstr "Isikhathi sokuqala sasendaweni sewindi lokulungisa lomhlaba wonke."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Ends"
msgstr "Iwindi Lokulungisa Liphela"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Local end time for the global maintenance window. An earlier end time continues into the next day."
msgstr "Isikhathi sokuphela sasendaweni sewindi lokulungisa lomhlaba wonke. Isikhathi sokuphela sangaphambili siqhubekela osukwini olulandelayo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "One-time Maintenance Starts"
msgstr "Ukulungiswa Kwakanye Kuphela Kuyaqala"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Optional local date and time to start a one-time global maintenance window."
msgstr "Usuku nesikhathi sendawo ongakukhetha ukuze uqale iwindi lokulungisa lomhlaba wonke lakanye kuphela."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "One-time Maintenance Ends"
msgstr "Ukulungiswa Kwakanye Kuphela Kuyaphela"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Optional local date and time to end a one-time global maintenance window. Format: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM."
msgstr "Usuku nesikhathi sendawo ongakukhetha ukuze uqede iwindi lokulungisa lomhlaba wonke lakanye kuphela. Ifomethi: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Alert Cooldown"
msgstr "Isikhathi Sokuphola Sesixwayiso Esizenzakalelayo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Suppress any repeat notification for the same rule and reporting scope for this many minutes. Per-rule values override this setting. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "Cindezela noma yisiphi isaziso esiphindayo somthetho ofanayo nobubanzi bokubika ngale mizuzu emingaka. Amanani omthetho ngamunye ashaya indiva lesi silungiselelo. Setha ku-0 ukuze ukhubaze."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Duplicate Suppression"
msgstr "Ukucindezelwa Kokuphindaphindiwe Okuzenzakalelayo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Suppress a notification with the same matched message set for this many minutes. Per-rule values override this setting. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "Cindezela isaziso esinesethi efanayo yemilayezo efanisiwe ngale mizuzu emingaka. Amanani omthetho ngamunye ashaya indiva lesi silungiselelo. Setha ku-0 ukuze ukhubaze."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Syslog Recovery"
msgstr "Ukubuyiselwa Kwe-Syslog Ekude"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum Recovery Records Per Execution"
msgstr "Amarekhodi Aphezulu Okubuyisela Ngomsebenzi Ngamunye"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of retained remote Syslog events sent to the Main Collector by one recovery worker execution. Each central database transaction remains capped at 100 records. Increase gradually while observing Main Collector load and lock waits."
msgstr "Inani eliphezulu lezehlakalo ze-Syslog ezikude ezigciniwe ezithunyelwa kuMqoqi Omkhulu ngokusebenza okukodwa komsebenzi wokubuyisela. Umsebenzi ngamunye wesizindalwazi esimaphakathi uhlala ukhawulelwe emarekhodini ayi-100. Khulisa kancane kancane ngenkathi ubheka umthwalo woMqoqi Omkhulu nezikhathi zokulinda ukukhiya."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Recovery Pause Between Batches"
msgstr "Ukuhlaba Ikhefu Kokubuyisela Phakathi Kwamaqoqo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pause between each 100-record Main Collector delivery transaction. A longer pause lowers Main Collector pressure; a shorter pause speeds backlog convergence."
msgstr "Misa isikhashana phakathi komsebenzi ngamunye wokulethwa kwe-Main Collector wamarekhodi angu-100. Ukumiswa okude kwehlisa ingcindezi ye-Main Collector; ukumiswa okufushane kusheshisa ukuqedwa kwesikweletu somsebenzi."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "No pause"
msgstr "Akukho ukumisa isikhashana"

