#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Alert command"
msgstr "Umyalo wesaziso"

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "When an Alert is triggered, run the following command.  The following replacement variables are available <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;ALERTID&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;MESSAGE&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;FACILITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;PRIORITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;SEVERITY&gt;'</b>.  Please note that <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b> is only available on individual thresholds.  These replacement values can appear on the command line, or be gathered from the environment of the script.  When used from the environment, those variables will be prefixed with 'ALERT_'."
msgstr "Uma Isexwayiso esiphuthumayo siqaliswa, sebenzisa lo myalo olandelayo. Okuguquguqukayo kokushintsha okulandelayo kuyatholakala <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;ALERTID&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;MESSAGE&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;FACILITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;PRIORITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;SEVERITY&gt;'</b>. Sicela uqaphele ukuthi i-<b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b> itholakala kuphela emikhawulweni eyodwa ngayodwa. Lawa manani okushintsha angavela emugqeni womyalo, noma aqoqe endaweni yesikripthi. Uma kusetshenziswa endaweni, lokho kuguquguqukayo kuzoba nesiqalo esithi 'ALERT_'."

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Recovery command"
msgstr "Umyalo wokubuyisela"

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Optional command to run when this threshold recovers after its quiet period. Uses the same replacement variables as Alert command. SYSLOG_EVENT is clear; SYSLOG_BREACH_ID matches the breach command. Failed commands are retried. Leave blank to disable."
msgstr "Umyalo ongakukhetha ozowusebenzisa lapho lo mkhawulo ululama ngemva kwesikhathi sawo sokuthula. Usebenzisa okuguquguqukayo okufanayo nokokushintsha njengomyalo Wesexwayiso. I-SYSLOG_EVENT icacile; i-SYSLOG_BREACH_ID ifana nomyalo wokuphula. Imiyalo ehlulekile iyazanywa futhi. Shiya kungenalutho ukuze ukhubaze."

