#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The supplier of the device or software that logs this message, for example Cisco or Juniper."
msgstr "Umhlinzeki wedivayisi noma isofthiwe efaka lo mlayezo kulogi, isibonelo i-Cisco noma i-Juniper."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Vendor"
msgstr "Umthengisi"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Identifier"
msgstr "Isihlonzi"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The message code to look for, for example %LINK-3-UPDOWN, RPD_OSPF_NBRDOWN or 4625. It must equal a whole word of the syslog message (letters, digits and _ . - /); a leading % is literal and must match as written. The match is not case sensitive. See How Recommendations Are Matched on the list page."
msgstr "Ikhodi yomyalezo okufanele uyibheke, isibonelo %LINK-3-UPDOWN, RPD_OSPF_NBRDOWN noma 4625. Kufanele ilingane negama lonke lomyalezo we-syslog (izinhlamvu, amadijithi kanye no-_ . - /); u-% oholayo ungokoqobo futhi kufanele ufane njengoba ubhaliwe. Ukufanisa akukhathali osonhlamvukazi noma osonhlamvuncane. Bheka okuthi Indlela Izincomo Ezifaniswa Ngayo ekhasini lohlu."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Component"
msgstr "Ingxenye"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The facility, module or subsystem that raises the message."
msgstr "Ifasiliti, imojuli noma uhlelo oluncane olukhipha umyalezo."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The severity the vendor documents for this message."
msgstr "Ubukhulu obubhalwe umthengisi ngalo mlayezo."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The message format as documented, including its variable placeholders."
msgstr "Ifomethi yomyalezo njengoba ibhaliwe, kubandakanya nezindawo zokubamba eziguqukayo zayo."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
