msgstr "Izixhumanisi eziya kumadokhumenti omthengisi, esisodwa ngomugqa."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Recommendation [edit]"
msgstr "Isincomo [hlela]"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Recommendation [new]"
msgstr "Isincomo [okusha]"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "A lightbulb before the message marks matching recommendations on the System Logs and Alert Logs tabs. Click the message to read them in the details flyout. Hovering never requests the server."
msgstr "Isibani ngaphambi komlayezo siphawula izincomo ezihambisanayo kumathebhu Wamalogi Esistimu Nawamalogi Ezexwayiso. Chofoza umlayezo ukuze uzifunde efasiteleni lemininingwane. Ukuhambisa igundane phezu kwaso akwenzeli isicelo kuseva."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Only the <b>Identifier</b> column is used for matching. The vendor, component, severity, message and explanation are shown in the details flyout but are never searched."
msgstr "Ikholomu ethi <b>Isihlonzi</b> kuphela esetshenziselwa ukufanisa. Umthengisi, ingxenye, ubukhulu, umlayezo kanye nencazelo kuboniswa kwiphaneli elivelayo lemininingwane kodwa akuseshwa nhlobo."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The first 2,048 characters of the message are split into words. A word is a run of letters, digits and the characters _ . - / that may start with %. Every other character, such as a space, colon, comma or bracket, ends a word. In <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN: Interface Gi0/1, changed state to down</code> the words are <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, <code>Interface</code>, <code>Gi0/1</code>, <code>changed</code>, <code>state</code>, <code>to</code> and <code>down</code>."
msgstr "Izinhlamvu zokuqala ezingu-2,048 zomyalezo zehlukaniswa zibe amagama. Igama liwuchungechunge lwezinhlamvu, amadijithi nezimpawu ezithi _ . - / ezingaqala ngo-%. Enye nenye impawu, njengesikhala, ikholoni, ikhefu noma ubakaki, iqeda igama. Kokuthi <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN: Interface Gi0/1, changed state to down</code> amagama yilawa <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, <code>Interface</code>, <code>Gi0/1</code>, <code>changed</code>, <code>state</code>, <code>to</code> kanye no-<code>down</code>."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "An identifier matches when it is <b>exactly equal to one whole word</b>, ignoring case. It is not a \"contains\", \"starts with\" or \"ends with\" search, and there are no wildcards: <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> does not match the word <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN-EXT</code>, and <code>UPDOWN</code> does not match <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>."
msgstr "Isikhombi siyafana uma <b>silingana ncamashi negama elilodwa eliphelele</b>, kunganakwa osonhlamvukazi nabancane. Akukhona ukusesha okuthi \"kuqukethe\", \"kuqala nge-\" noma \"kuphela nge-\", futhi azikho izimpawu zokusiza: i-<code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> ayifani negama elithi <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN-EXT</code>, futhi i-<code>UPDOWN</code> ayifani ne-<code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "A leading <b>%</b> is literal, not a wildcard, and must match the message word as written. An identifier <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> matches the message word <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, not <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>; an identifier without the prefix matches only the unprefixed word."
msgstr "Uphawu lokuqala oluthi <b>%</b> luyisibonakalisi soqobo, hhayi i-wildcard, futhi kufanele luhambisane negama lomlayezo njengoba libhaliwe. Isikhombi esithi <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> sihambisana negama lomlayezo elithi <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, hhayi elithi <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>; isikhombi esingenasiqalo sihambisana kuphela negama elingenasiqalo."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "When the syslog host is a Cacti device whose vendor is recognised from its SNMP system description or device template, and recommendations exist for that vendor, only that vendor's recommendations and those without a vendor are checked. Otherwise all vendors are checked, but an identifier made only of digits matches only recommendations without a vendor. When several recommendations match, the longest identifiers are shown first, up to three."
msgstr "Uma umsingathi we-syslog kuyidivayisi ye-Cacti umthengisi wayo obonakala encazelweni yesistimu ye-SNMP noma esifanekisweni sedivayisi, futhi izincomo zikhona zalowo mthengisi, kuhlolwa kuphela izincomo zalowo mthengisi nalezo ezingenawo umthengisi. Ngaphandle kwalokho bonke abathengisi bayahlolwa, kodwa isikhombi esenziwe ngezinombolo kuphela sifana nezincomo ezingenawo umthengisi kuphela. Uma kufana izincomo eziningana, izikhombi ezinde kakhulu zikhonjiswa kuqala, kuze kufike kwezintathu."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Identifiers that contain other characters, such as the <code>#</code> slot placeholder or the <code>|</code> alternatives in some vendor documentation (for example <code>%ASA|PIX-3-331001</code>), are kept and exported but can never match. Set <b>Can Match</b> to No to list them, and edit them into the exact code, for example <code>%ASA-3-331001</code>."
msgstr "Izihlonzi eziqukethe ezinye izinhlamvu, ezifana nesibambi sendawo se-slot esingu-<code>#</code> noma ezinye izindlela zika-<code>|</code> kwezinye izincwadi zabathengisi (isibonelo <code>%ASA|PIX-3-331001</code>), ziyagcinwa futhi zikhishwe kodwa azikwazi ukufana nakanye. Setha okuthi <b>Kungafana</b> ku-Cha ukuze uzifake ohlwini, bese uzihlela zibe ikhodi eqondile, isibonelo <code>%ASA-3-331001</code>."

